      "MISS BRUBECK: Do you have a science project, Juli?\nJULI: No. But I will.\nMISS BRUBECK: Of course you will.\nJULI: Although I wish I knew what it was.",
      "JULI: I might hatch chickens for the science project. Miss Brubeck can get me eggs --\nTRINA: Why don’t you just grow beans?\nJULI: That’s like a third-grade thing.",
      "JULI: You could?\nTRINA: Something smells funny in here. Do you smell something funny?",
      "LYNETTA: Why I bother helping you I will never know. I know, build a computer.\nPATSY: What’s the Baker girl doing?",
      "JULI: Bonnie’s heart is beating.\nTRINA: Congratulations. You’re a mother.\nTRINA: I still smell that smell."
    ]
